OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry in the south today
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells and feeling very
OL,7,Fhot. Cloudier further north and west
OL,8,Fwith outbreaks of rain at times,
OL,9,Fparticularly across Scotland.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA few isolated thunderstorms
OL,12,Fare possible in southern England this
OL,13,Fevening. Otherwise, largely dry with a
OL,14,Fwarm night. Cloudy elsewhere with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain and a risk of
OL,16,Fthunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
