OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FOutbreaks of heavy rain in
OL,6,Fthe north today with a risk of
OL,7,Fthunder. Scattered showers in the
OL,8,Fsouth with the odd thunderstorm. Vary
OL,9,Fwarm and humid. Windy in the north.
